o_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "www.scottishdailyexpress.co.uk", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVQtVPoy.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://www.scottishdailyexpress.co.uk/news/politics/john-swinney-refuses-meet-orange-37677648", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Scotland: First Minister John Swinney Refuses To Meet With Orange Order Despite Vow To Be \u201cFirst Minister For All Of Scotland\u201d. This Comes A Week After His Party Cosied Up To Far-Left Sinn Fein-IRA Making A Pact To Break Up The UK. ", "last_comment_created": 1790343669312, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 5, "score_up": 23, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "Exclusive: A Unionist summit was held in Edinburgh on Thursday to mark a closer relationship between Northern Ireland and Scotland in response to the deal between the SNP and Sinn Fein.", "large_image": "nCFbSyFTpuZcEJ4f.png", "title": "John Swinney snubs the Orange Order despite vow to represent 'all of Scotland'"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVQtV8uG", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 29, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8855038, "raw_content": " Jennifer Siebel Newsom admitted to having sex with Harvey Weinstein.\n#Cali \nThe defense in the trial said  she had consensual sex with him in 2005, then later claimed it was r*pe after #MeToo hit the headlines. \nWeinstein attorney Mark Werksman said she wanted the most powerful producer in Hollywood to help her acting and producing career, so she went to his suite and had s*x with him. \nWeinstein pleaded not guilty to the charges tied to her - forcible r*pe and forcible oral copulation. \nThey pointed to the fact that she stayed in contact with him, sending him emails, then later soliciting campaign donations from him. \nThat is not how a r*pe victim behaves, they said.\n#trial \n\ud83d\udd3a\ufe0fStarting about nine months after the September 2005 hotel meeting, Siebel Newsom wrote Weinstein asking if he was free for coffee or lunch to talk film projects. \n\ud83d\udd3a\ufe0fShe apologized for missing him at the next Toronto festival, and she kept sending emails.\n\ud83d\udd3a\ufe0fYears later, a Gavin Newsom campaign solicited a $500 donation from Weinstein.\n\ud83d\udd3a\ufe0fSeibel Newsom admitted she told campaign staff to ask him. \nThe defense walked her through those messages one by one and asked why a woman who said she had been r*ped would keep chasing meetings with the man she said r*ped her.\nShe said the emails were business and that running into him at industry events was weird and scary. \nOn the stand, she also said she could not remember some of the messages Werksman put in front of her.\u200b\n\ud83d\udd37\ufe0fProsecutors told a different story:\n\ud83d\udd37\ufe0fShe said she met Weinstein at the Toronto International Film Festival in 2005 when she was 31, still trying to break into the industry.\n\ud83d\udd37\ufe0fWeeks later,  he invited her to what she thought was a career meeting in Los Angeles.\n\ud83d\udd37\ufe0fShe said he grabbed her, pulled off her underwear,  and forced himself on her. \n\ud83d\udd37\ufe0fShe said he also performed oral sex on her. \n\ud83d\udd37\ufe0fThen she said she made \u201cpleasure noises\u201d and used her hand so he would finish and she could 'get out of there'", "author": "Albatrosslover", "created": 1790326052527, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "SnowSnake", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Weinstein's little whore..... ", "last_comment_created": 1790328346465, "content": "<p>Jennifer Siebel Newsom admitted to having sex with Harvey Weinstein.\n#Cali\nThe defense in the trial said  she had consensual sex with him in 2005, then later claimed it was r<em>pe after #MeToo hit the headlines.\nWeinstein attorney Mark Werksman said she wanted the most powerful producer in Hollywood to help her acting and producing career, so she went to his suite and had s</em>x with him.\nWeinstein pleaded not guilty to the charges tied to her - forcible r<em>pe and forcible oral copulation.\nThey pointed to the fact that she stayed in contact with him, sending him emails, then later soliciting campaign donations from him.\nThat is not how a r</em>pe victim behaves, they said.\n#trial\n\ud83d\udd3a\ufe0fStarting about nine months after the September 2005 hotel meeting, Siebel Newsom wrote Weinstein asking if he was free for coffee or lunch to talk film projects.\n\ud83d\udd3a\ufe0fShe apologized for missing him at the next Toronto festival, and she kept sending emails.\n\ud83d\udd3a\ufe0fYears later, a Gavin Newsom campaign solicited a $500 donation from Weinstein.\n\ud83d\udd3a\ufe0fSeibel Newsom admitted she told campaign staff to ask him.\nThe defense walked her through those messages one by one and asked why a woman who said she had been r<em>ped would keep chasing meetings with the man she said r</em>ped her.\nShe said the emails were business and that running into him at industry events was weird and scary.\nOn the stand, she also said she could not remember some of the messages Werksman put in front of her.\u200b\n\ud83d\udd37\ufe0fProsecutors told a different story:\n\ud83d\udd37\ufe0fShe said she met Weinstein at the Toronto International Film Festival in 2005 when she